name        = "NS2 SUD Server Management"
source_dir  = "source"
output_dir  = "output"
description = [=[[h1]NS2 SUD Server Management[/h1]
Server tools for the NS2 Sudamerica server. No gameplay changes.

[h1]Matches in a row[/h1]
[list]
[*]Type [b]!freqplayers[/b] in chat to see the 5 players with the most rounds in a row and the 5 with the most minutes played over them. Only you see the answer
[*]When a spectator is waiting for a slot, anyone can check who has had their turn
[*]Sit a round out and your count goes back to 0
[*]Subbing in partway through a round counts as sitting it out, so helping a team never costs you
[*]Joining a team in the first 2 minutes of a round counts as playing it, even if you step out later
[*]Counts carry over map changes and start fresh each play session. Rounds shorter than 3 minutes don't count
[/list]
]=]
